  "method": "delete",
  "operation": {
    "summary": "Delete Time Tracking",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Deletes a time-tracking entry by id. Requires an API key with the `time_tracking.write` scope. Callers without the *Edit all timesheets* permission can only delete their own entries. If the entry's date falls inside a closed accounting period, the deletion is rejected and the response body is `{\"error\": true, \"errors\": {\"date\": \"<reason>\"}}`.",
